# The pistol held for six seconds with nothing to hit: a shot every 9 ticks
# (3.5 a second), the magazine's twelve rounds, a reload (the weapon's first-
# person animation, after its recoil) and then twelve more.
scenario pistol_magazine
map bloodgulch
start flat_field 77.9 -166.2 0.32 0.0
weapon weapons/pistol/pistol
ticks 460
input 60 420 fire=1

tolerance position 0
tolerance velocity 0
tolerance facing 0
tolerance state 0
tolerance rounds 0
tolerance heat 0
tolerance shield 0
tolerance body 0
tolerance stun 0
tolerance life 0
tolerance hit 0
